Public corpus (synthetic fixtures only)
---------------------------------------

The public git tree and the hosted demo at mechanic-rag.vercel.app use
synthetic fixtures only. The committed public corpus is
fixtures/honda_s2000_demo/ (manifest rights_class = synthetic_fixture;
provenance.transform_name = synthetic_author). The service-manual text in
that tree is original demo content. It is not OEM manual text and is not
extracted from Honda service publications.

This repository does not claim OEM rights. It does not authorize
reproduction, redistribution, or sublicensing of OEM service manuals or
other manufacturer documentation. Official vehicle names (for example
Honda, S2000) appear only as catalog / vehicle_id labels for the
synthetic demo. No affiliation, endorsement, or license from any
manufacturer is claimed or implied.

Private / garage corpora, if used at all, stay outside this public tree
(local gold roots; never the public clone default).

Third-party software and hosted services
----------------------------------------

This git tree does not vendor third-party source trees or copy their
upstream NOTICE files. Direct dependencies are declared in
pyproject.toml and web/package.json. Locked versions are in uv.lock and
web/pnpm-lock.yaml. Each installed package carries its own license with
the artifact from the registry. Those licenses are independent of
PolyForm Noncommercial unless a given package says otherwise.

This NOTICE does not invent per-package copyright holders, license
texts, or a complete transitive bill of materials. Read the installed
package metadata for those notices.

The hosted demo runs on free-tier Vercel, Supabase, and Gemini. Local
clone uses Compose Postgres + pgvector (image pgvector/pgvector:pg16)
and host Ollama. Runtime models named in README (Gemini API models;
Ollama nomic-embed-text / gemma4:e2b or documented fallbacks; optional
local MiniLM CE weights) are pulled or called at runtime. This
repository does not redistribute those model weights or those providers'
software.

